                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "17 feature bullets: integrated search, RSS with regex filters, bandwidth scheduler, sequential download, IP filtering. Users still run qbit_manage / qBitrr for share limits and cleanup.",
