                      "fill": "$muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Its own page names no RSS, no search engine, no scheduler, no sequential download. The pitch is \"easy-to-use defaults\", watch directories and a blocklist.",
